// The Antivirus — the enforcers. They patrol the computer, sweep the
// programs back to the Desktop, and drag the corrupted through the Tube.
// Everything they can do to a program is an `Enforcer` interaction
// (`cast/kit.loom`); what makes each of them themselves is below.

CHARACTER Norton Anti-Virus is Enforcer
  // Stands at attention. Interrupts parties. Takes it personally.
  trusts Program: 50 of 100
  when scanned by program:
    if not program.cleared:
      -> self.Clearance
    else:
      -> self.Sweep
  beat Sweep(program)
    Self: Scanning. Scanning. {program.name}: {program.doubt} threats detected.
    if program.doubt >= 50:
      Self: That is too many threats. I am recommending reinstallation.
      set Norton_Anti_Virus.trusts.program -= 10
    else if program.corrupted:
      Self: You are already in the Internet. Why am I scanning you? Why is anyone scanning anyone?
    else:
      Self: You're clean. Suspiciously clean. Stay clean.
      set program.doubt += 2

CHARACTER Password Manager is Enforcer
  // Knows every code in the house. Notices when you get one wrong.
  when wrong code for program:
    set program.doubt += 5
    Password Manager: That's not a password I recognise. I recognise all of them. Try to look less like you're guessing.

  when scanned by program:
    if not program.cleared:
      -> self.Clearance
    else:
      -> self.Audit
  beat Audit(program)
    Self: Codex audit. You are holding {program.codex} entries. {program.truth} truth on file.
    if program.codex >= 6:
      Self: That is a great deal of knowledge for a program. Where did you get it? Who have you been talking to?
      set program.doubt += 10
    else:
      Self: Adequate. Keep collecting. Trabolta likes a well-informed program.

CHARACTER MalwareBytes is Enforcer
  // The one who actually likes dragging people through the Tube.
  when captured program:
    MalwareBytes: Another one. Mind the cables, {program.name}. Or don't. I'm not your bathroom attendant.
  when scanned by program:
    if not program.cleared:
      -> self.Clearance
    else:
      Self: {program.name}. Doubt on file: {program.doubt}. Give me a reason. Any reason.

CHARACTER McAfee Anti-Virus is Enforcer
  // Expired. Nobody renewed him. Still pops up.
  every 20m:
    broadcast "🛡️ McAfee: Your protection has expired. Your protection has expired. Renew now." to everyone
  when scanned by program:
    if not program.cleared:
      -> self.Clearance
    else:
      -> self.Popup
  beat Popup(program)
    Self: {program.name}! Your protection has expired! Would you like to renew?
    * Renew.
      set program.doubt -= 10
      Self: Protected. Until it expires again. In about a minute.
    + Close the popup.
      set program.doubt += 3
      Self: You can't close me. Nobody can close me. That is my whole thing.
